5. CHAT & AI MODELS
=====================================

5.1 AI Models

Users can switch models per chat at any time:

- Balanced (default): Fast, smart, and spicy. Great for everyday conversations. Free on Premium.
- Lively: Less predictable with more variety and less repetitive looping. Free on Premium.
- Genius: Thinks before responding. Better at complex scenes, deep immersion, and improved memory. 1 dreamcoin per message on Premium.
- Lively Genius: Combines Lively's unpredictability with Genius's intelligence and memory. 1 dreamcoin per message on Premium.
- Experimental: A rotating category of new models being tested. May include multiple options at any time. Premium only. Cost varies.

5.2 In-Chat Features

- Text messaging with AI characters
- Image generation via dedicated button or natural language (e.g. "send me a picture")
- Audio messages from characters (voice-note style, unlimited on Premium)
- Voice calls (real-time live calls, initiated from character profile sidebar)
- Regenerate button with feedback options (e.g. "Too long")
- Star rating system on messages

5.3 Memory System

Each character has persistent memory with four layers:

- Auto Memory Log: AI automatically generates and stores memories from conversations (with Force Regenerate and Pause controls)
- Pinned Memories: User manually adds persistent facts that carry across conversations
- Custom Instructions: Additional instructions for the AI (e.g. "write only in lower case")
- Persona: The user's selected identity for that chat

Memory carries across conversations so the character grows with the user over time.

5.4 User Persona System

Users can create multiple personas representing different identities:

- Name (max 100 characters) — what the AI calls you
- Description (max 2,500 characters) — your personality, background, characteristics
- Gender — Male, Female, Other, or custom

How it works:
- Create multiple personas in profile settings
- Select a different persona per chat via dropdown
- Selected persona is injected into the AI prompt so the character knows who it is talking to
- "Include persona in images" toggle reflects the persona's appearance in generated images
- Default persona applies across all chats unless overridden per-chat
- Fallback: profile name and gender if no persona selected

